.TH NOVADOCK 1 "December 2024" "NovaDock 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
novadock \- macOS-style dock and application launcher for XFCE4
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B novadock
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
NovaDock is a modern dock and full-screen application launcher designed for XFCE4,
featuring macOS-style magnification effects, app indicators, and a customizable
plugin system.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-launcher
Open the full-screen application launcher directly.
.TP
.B \-\-settings
Open the settings window.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display help information.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Display version information.
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Dock Panel
Animated dock with magnification effect on hover, running app indicators,
and drag-and-drop icon reordering.
.TP
.B Application Launcher
Full-screen launchpad with grid view, real-time search, and keyboard navigation.
.TP
.B Pin/Unpin Apps
Right-click to pin running apps or unpin favorites from the dock.
.TP
.B Plugin System
Extensible architecture supporting custom dock plugins. Built-in plugins
include Trash, Show Desktop, and Separator.
.TP
.B Theming
Installable themes for dock customization. Themes are stored in
~/.local/share/novadock/themes/
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/novadock/config.ini
User configuration file containing pinned apps, dock settings, and enabled plugins.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/novadock/themes/
User-installed themes directory.
.TP
.I /usr/share/novadock/themes/
System-wide themes directory.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is stored in INI format. Example:
.PP
.nf
[Dock]
pinned=org.gnome.Nautilus;firefox;org.gnome.Terminal
icon_size=48
magnification=1.5
auto_hide=false
position=bottom
theme=default

[Plugins]
enabled=trash;show-desktop
.fi
.SH THEME FORMAT
Themes use INI format with the following sections:
.PP
.nf
[Theme]
name=My Theme

[Background]
red=0.15
green=0.15
blue=0.15
alpha=0.75

[Border]
red=1.0
green=1.0
blue=1.0
alpha=0.15

[Indicator]
red=1.0
green=1.0
blue=1.0
alpha=0.9

[Style]
corner_radius=16
border_width=1
.fi
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Escape
Close the application launcher.
.TP
.B Any key
Focus search bar in launcher and start typing.
.SH AUTHOR
Written for XFCE4 desktop environment.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at: https://github.com/novadock/novadock/issues
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xfce4-panel (1)
